  epo:hasPurpose <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/7377a246-e4aa-4caf-a227-43094ab1e85c-01/PartPurpose$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_ProcurementProject1>;
  epo:isCoveredByGPA false;
  epo:isSubjectToTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/7377a246-e4aa-4caf-a227-43094ab1e85c-01/ReviewTerm/ORG-0002>;
  epo:usesChannel <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/7377a246-e4aa-4caf-a227-43094ab1e85c-01/AdHocChannel$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1>;
  dct:description """This project aims to increase the capacity of various stakeholders, including all relevant national
institutions, to access and utilize climate finance. The project has 5 components:
1. Inception activities;
2. Drafting of a National Climate Finance Strategy;
3. Sustainable Finance Ecosystem and Taxonomy;
4. Institutional Capacity Building;
5. Visibility Activities.
Taking international and national sustainable finance context and development into account, the project will improve national capacity to mobilise and effectively manage climate finance flows to support Türkiye's national climate change targets."""@en;
  dct:title "Strengthening the National Capacity of Climate Finance"@en;
